bino (2.8-1+stereo3d1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to upstream 2.8 (release tarball, signature checked). Fix the
    eye order of right-first stereo videos (the ffprobe inverted flag is
    a number). Always use OpenGL stereo output in the GUI (the edition
    draws every output through KWin), settings in ~/.config/Bino3D-
    stereo. Desktop entry runs Bino on X11 until its stereo output works
    on Wayland. Depend on ffmpeg (ffprobe) and libxcb-cursor0.

